{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_16_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，正月，甲戌、己丑，陳侯鮑卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"鮑卒何為以二日卒之？春秋之義，信以傳信，疑以傳疑。陳侯以甲戌之日出，己丑之日得，不知死之日，故舉二日以包也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊侯、鄭伯如紀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"三、天王使任叔之子來聘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"任叔之子者，錄父以使子也，故微其君臣而著其父子，不正。父在子代仕之辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"四、葬陳桓公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"五、城祝丘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"六、秋，蔡人、衞人、陳人從王伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"舉從者之辭也。其舉從者之辭何也？為天王諱伐鄭也。鄭，同姓之國也，在乎冀州，於是不服，為天子病矣。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"七、大雩。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"八、螽。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"蟲災也。甚則月，不甚則時。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"九、冬，州公如曹。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_16_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_16","textTraditional":"外相如不書，此其書何也？過我也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}